WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
Start with My Tickets when you want your own work rather than the entire studio queue.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.360
Inspect the owner and the status on a row before opening it.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.540
Switch to Department to see work in your department's queue.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:16.560
If you need a ticket outside that view, move to All Tickets and search by its number.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.710
Your access permissions still apply.
